*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin  binary
*.ckpt binary
*.pt   binary
*.gguf binary
*.onnx binary
*.db   binary
